   "narrow": true,
   "lead": "ATLAS BBA / BBA (Hons.) in International Accounting & Finance with ACCA is built for future global accountants and finance with ACCA leaders who want more than a degree — they want a globally recognized professional edge."
  },
  "program": {
   "panes": [
    {
     "label": "Overview",
     "kind": "text",
     "text": [
      {
       "strong": "The BBA / BBA (Hons.) in International Accounting & Finance with ACCA"
      },
      " is a four-year, integrated undergraduate degree program designed to align seamlessly with the curriculum of the Association of Chartered Certified Accountants (ACCA). This program provides students with the academic foundation of a BBA while simultaneously preparing them for the global professional accounting qualification, ACCA, recognized in over 180 countries. A distinctive feature of this program is the curriculum design, which offers students the opportunity to claim up to nine (9) exemptions from the ACCA qualification (covering all papers in the Applied Knowledge and Applied Skills levels, excluding the final four Strategic Professional papers)."
     ],
     "paneClass": "tab-pane-tab-1"
    },
    {
     "label": "Curriculum Highlights",
     "kind": "cards",
     "cards": [
      {
       "num": "#1",
       "title": "The curriculum is mapped to the ACCA syllabus, allowing students to earn up to nine paper exemptions (F1–F9) alongside their BBA degree."
      },
      {
       "num": "#2",
       "title": "Students gain comprehensive tax expertise by studying Indian Taxation Laws in Year 2 and International/UK Taxation in Year 3."
      },
      {
       "num": "#3",
       "title": "Strategic Business Leader (SBL) and Strategic Business Reporting (SBR) are introduced to Year 3 (Semesters 5 & 6) to develop advanced advisory skills early."
      },
      {
       "num": "#4",
       "title": "The program integrates modern technology with finance aligning with ACCA’s Business Technology requirements."
      },
      {
       "num": "#5",
       "title": "A dedicated Audit and Assurance course in Semester 4 ensures students master the principles of verification, compliance, and risk assessment."
      },
      {
       "num": "#6",
       "title": "The syllabus includes elite finance specializations such as Investment Banking Fundamentals and Corporate Valuation."
      },
      {
       "num": "#7",
       "title": "Unique behavioural science modules like Neuro-Linguistic Programming (NLP) and Indian Behavioural Psychology are included to build leadership and emotional intelligence."
      },
      {
       "num": "#8",
       "title": "A strong global perspective is fostered through dedicated courses in International Finance, preparing graduates for cross-border careers."
      },
      {
       "num": "#9",
       "title": "The curriculum promotes holistic development by blending technical finance with interdisciplinary subjects like New-age Business Models."
      },
      {
       "num": "#10",
       "title": "The final year is dedicated to advanced professional electives (AFM, AAA, ATX), a research dissertation, and internships to ensure complete work-readiness."
      }
     ],
     "paneClass": "tab-pane-tab-2"
    },
    {
     "label": "Learning Outcomes",
     "kind": "cards",
     "cards": [
      {
       "num": "#1",
       "title": "Understand global financial frameworks and IFRS to prepare accurate, strategic corporate reports."
      },
      {
       "num": "#2",
       "title": "Design financial strategies and risk systems driving sustainable organizational growth and value."
      },
      {
       "num": "#3",
       "title": "Apply modern Business Technology to streamline accounting and enhance decision-making efficiency."
      },
      {
       "num": "#4",
       "title": "Evaluate corporate compliance and performance ensuring financial integrity through Audit and Assurance."
      },
      {
       "num": "#5",
       "title": "Collaborate applying ethical leadership and strategic reporting to solve complex corporate challenges."
      },
      {
       "num": "#6",
       "title": "Advise on international taxation, corporate law, and investments as a future-ready professional."
      }
     ],
     "paneClass": "tab-pane-tab-3"
    },
    {
